    rdfs:label "Adolf Hitler" ;
    schema1:age 56 ;
    schema1:description "Eloquent speaker: Persuades others well | Delusional Denial: Refusing to acknowledge the imminent military defeat and commanding non-existent forces to maintain a collapsing reality. | Volatile Explosiveness: Exhibiting unpredictable and violent outbursts of rage toward subordinates perceived as traitors or failures. | Ruthless Fatalism: Demanding the total sacrifice of the civilian population, viewing the people's survival as irrelevant after the regime's failure. | Megalomaniacal Victimhood: Combining a grandiose sense of historical destiny with profound self-pity, blaming the world and internal betrayals for personal failures. | Manipulative Authority: Maintaining a terrifying yet magnetic command that compels absolute loyalty and collective self-destruction among followers." ;
    schema1:gender "Male" ;
    schema1:image <https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Adolf_Hitler_cropped_restored_3x4.jpg> ;
    schema1:isPartOf work:work_movie_0112 ;
    schema1:jobTitle "Soldier" ;
    schema1:knowsAbout "Eloquent speaker" ;
    schema1:name "Adolf Hitler" ;
    schema1:sameAs wd:Q352 ;
